{"id":"633008","name":"酸奶西多士","author":"Dinaking","authorId":"12567629","desc":"","cover":"images/633008/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"吐司","amount":"2片"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"一个"}],"sub":[{"name":"酸奶","amount":"一杯"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好所有材料。","img":"images/633008/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"鸡蛋打散备用。","img":"images/633008/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"吐司切成6等份。","img":"images/633008/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"其中三份上加入酸奶。","img":"images/633008/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"然后盖上另外三片。","img":"images/633008/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"给吐司块上裹满鸡蛋液。","img":"images/633008/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放上空气炸锅内。","img":"images/633008/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"设置温度180°烤10分钟。","img":"images/633008/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"分钟的时候翻个面。","img":"images/633008/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"然后就可以吃了。","img":"images/633008/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"外酥里软，口感超赞。","img":"images/633008/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"完成。","img":"images/633008/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：空气炸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}